## Import

CronJobs can be imported using the namespace and name, separated by `/`:

```shell
terraform import kubernetes_cron_job_v1.demo default/demo
```

For an existing `kubernetes_cron_job_v1` state entry, a provider upgrade does not require import or a `moved` block. To change from the deprecated `kubernetes_cron_job` resource type, follow the [migration guide](../guides/batch-v1-framework-migration.md#moving-from-deprecated-resource-types), including its warning about the legacy `batch/v1beta1` endpoint.
